  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.1.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.1.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Apostolica narrat auctoritas: Sine fide impossibile esse ut quisquam placeat Deo.",
    "chunk_index": 1,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.1.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.1.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nos ergo fideliter credimus Patrem , Filium et Spiritum sanctum, unum verum solum Deum in essentiali substantia , ac sanctam et individuam personalem aeternitatem.",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.1.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.1.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Deitas enim Christi par in omnibus et consubstan­ Hatis est Patri, et sempiterna atque intemporaliter una eademque potentia genitoris et geniti.",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.1.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.1.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Creator quippe omnium naturarum; quoniam per ipsum omnia facta sunt, et sine ipso factum est nihil, su­ perior est omnibus quæ creavit,",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.1.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.1.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "nec umquam crea­ tori suo non fuerunt subjecta quae condidit: cui proprium et sempiternum est nec aliunde quam de Patre, nec alium esse quam Pater est.",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.1.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.1.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Huic si ad­ dita esset potestas, si illustrata dignitas, si euI­ tata sublimitas, minor erat provehente qui creavit, nec habebat divitias ejus naturae, cujus indiguit largitate.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.2.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "In ea plenitudine temporis , quæ sempiterno con­ silio fuerat praestituta , et prophetica dictorum at­ que gestorum significatione promissa ,",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.2.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "factus filius hominis non suae conversione substantiæ , sed nos­ træ assumpiione naturae , venit quærere et salvare quod perierat.",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.2.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Venit autem non locali accessu nec motione corporea, tamquam praesens futurus unde adfuisset, aut illinc recessurus unde venisset , sed venit per hoc quod erat visibilis et cunctis cernen­ tibus declarandus.",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.2.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Humanam scilicet carnem atque animam in visceribus virginis matris accipiens , ut manens in forma Dei, servi formam assumeret,",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.2.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "et in similitudine carnis peccatorum veniret, per quam non minueret divina humanis, sed augeret divinis humana.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.2.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Talis enim erat omnium a primis ducta genitoribus causa mortalium , ut originali peccato transeunte per posteros, nullus poenam damnatio­ nis evaderet, nisi Verbum caro fieret et habitaret in nobis.",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.2.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quod deitatis est, caro non minuit; quod carnis est, deitas non peremit.",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.2.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Idem enim et sempi­ ternus ex Patre; et temporalis ex matre , in sua virtute inviolabilis, in nostra infirmitate passibilis.",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.2.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "In deitate tantum et cum Patre et cum Spiritu sancto unius ejusdemque naturæ ; in susceptione autem hominis, non unius substantiæ, sed unius ejus­ demque personæ :",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.2.s10",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "ut idem esset dives in pauper­ tate, omnipotens in submissione, impassibilis in supplicio , immortalis in morte.",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.2.s11",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nec enim Verbuin aut in carnem aut in animam aliqua sui parte con­ versum est; cum simplex et immutabilis natura dei­ talis tota in sua sit semper essentia ;",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.2.s12",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.2.s12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "nec damuum sibi recipiens nec augmenlum ; et sic assumptam naturam beatificans, ut glorificata; in glorificante permaneat.",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.3.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.3.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Cur autem inconveniens ant impossibile videatur, ut Verbum et caro atque anima unus homo Christus et unus Dei hominisque sit Filius,",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.3.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.3.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "si caro et anima, qu:c dissimilium naturarum sunt, unam faciunt, etiam sine Verbi incarnatione , a personam ?",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.3.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.3.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Cum multo facilius sit, ut hanc unitatem sui atque ho­ minis, deitatis praestet potestas, quam ut eam in substantiis suis obtineat solius humanitatis infirmi­ tas.",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.3.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.3.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nec Verbum igitur in carnem , nec in Verbum caro mutata est: sed utrumque in uno manet, et unus in utroque est:",
    "chunk_index": 22,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.3.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.3.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "non diversitate divisus, non permixtione confusus, nec alter ex Patre, alter ex matre ;",
    "chunk_index": 23,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.3.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.3.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "sed idem ex Patrc ante omne principium, et idem in iine sæculorum ut esset mediator Dei et lio- A Rectissime Ambrosius personam , non naturam dicit.",
    "chunk_index": 24,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.3.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.3.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nam si contra una hominis natura dicitur , ut plerique loqui solent, hoc exemplo mire abutuntur Monophysitæ , ut unam Christi naturam affirment.",
    "chunk_index": 25,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.3.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.3.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Re autem vera dux sunt in homine naturae sen sub­ stantiae; spiritalis , anima; materialis, caro.",
    "chunk_index": 26,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.3.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.3.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Lega­ tur de hoc exemplo praeclara Albanasii doctrina, ed. Maur. t. I, p. ig79. minum , homo Jesus Christus in quo habitaret p!e- , nitudo divinitatis.",
    "chunk_index": 27,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.4.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.4.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nativitas enim Domini secundum carnem quam­ vis habeat quædam propria , quibus humanæ con­ ditionis initia transcendat, sive quod solus ab in­ violata virgine sine concupiscentia est conceptus et natus;",
    "chunk_index": 28,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.4.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.4.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "sive quod ita e visceribus matris est editus ut fecunditas pareret, el virginitas permaneret; non alterius tamen naturae erat ejus caro quam nos­ tra est:",
    "chunk_index": 29,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.4.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.4.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "nec alio illi quam cæteris hominibus anima est inspirata principio, quæ excelleret non diver­ sitate generis sed sublimitate virtutis.",
    "chunk_index": 30,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep#PL17.EP.4.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.4.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nihil enim carnis suæ habebat adversum; non discordia des:­ deriorum gignebat compugnantiam voluptatum :",
    "chunk_index": 31,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
