    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_38_ep",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.EP.4.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "sen­ sus corporei vigebant sine leae peccati, et veritas affectionum sub moderamine deitatis et mentis, nec tentabatur illecebris , nec cedebat in vitiis :",
